  "evidencia": "Page: Pete Dexter. Sentence: Pete Dexter (born July 22, 1943) is an American novelist.\nPage: Elie Wiesel. Sentence: Eliezer \"Elie\" Wiesel KBE ( , Yiddish: אליעזר ויזל‎ , \"Elyezer Vizel\"; September 30, 1928 – July 2, 2016) was a Romanian-born American Jewish writer, professor, political activist, Nobel Laureate and Holocaust survivor.\nPage: Mulholland Falls. Sentence: Mulholland Falls is a 1996 American neo-noir crime thriller film directed by Lee Tamahori, written by Pete Dexter, and starring an ensemble cast featuring Nick Nolte, Jennifer Connelly, Chazz Palminteri, Michael Madsen, Chris Penn, Melanie Griffith, Andrew McCarthy, Treat Williams, and John Malkovich.\nPage: Daniel Baldwin. Sentence: He has had other starring roles, including \"\" (1992), \"Mulholland Falls\" (1996), \"Vampires\" (1998), \"The Pandora Project\" (1998), \"Stealing Candy\" (2002), \"Paparazzi\" (2004) and \"Grey Gardens\" (2009).",
